      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAXIMUM PENALTY (1) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 4.5 lengths at this track in a handy 25.31 beating Starlord Bale. The form out of his last race has been franked. Expected to be right there at the finish again. DOONGALLA PARODY (2) was game in defeat off the inside draw last start, finishing third and beaten 1.5 lengths (26.03) behind Silken Kennedy at Geelong. Well placed and gets her chance. GRASS IS GREENER (4) scored two back when on speed but last start drifted back and could manage only a 4.5 lengths 5th at this track (25.72). The form from his last run stacks up well. Has ability and is one of the better chances. CAN DO GRACE (8) is a last-start placegetter worth considering.",
